        "Description": "Good Evening 47\r\rWe have noticed that our Training only Featured 1 Target and No Complications. Something that most of the Contracts have, so we created this Test. Eliminate Yuri Abdulov and his Partner Cilas Netzke. You also have to Hide all the Bodies.\rCilas Netzke can be found walking near many Soldiers so disguising as a Sowjet Soldier would be helpful. Yuri Abdulov can be found on the roof of the Building walking in Circles.\r\rGood Luck",
